abstract: >-
  An auditable spectral-to-physics calculation chain that carries one finite
  source record through effective couplings, matter scales, macroscopic tensor
  response and cosmological observables. The V5 release keeps generated
  quantities, comparison data, normalizations and approximations distinct while
  providing provenance-preserving response maps, interval certificates,
  fixed-input propagation and independent regression checks.
keywords:
  - spectral datum
  - coarse-graining
  - gauge structure
  - fermion content
  - mass scales
  - mathematical physics
  - computational physics
  - spectral geometry
  - cosmology
  - reproducible research
